The default should be `TRUE` to indicate that quotes should be automatically where needed. You'd use `quote = FALSE` in the first pass of your `pillar_shaft()` method implementation so you can take advantage of an existing format method:

```R
pillar_shaft.percent <- function(x) {
  pillar::pillar_shaft(format(x), quote = FALSE)
}
```
